| Use an explicitly invoked workflow | [Explicit-only catalog](catalog/explicit.md) | Includes planning, tickets, teaching, handoffs, UI prototypes, and session retrospectives. Preserve each skill's explicit-invocation boundary. |

## Availability and fallback

